## iconGroup template

Single template entry in `interactions.json`:

```json
{
  "id": "icon_video_360",
  "interactionType": "iconGroup",
  "scene": ["main_scene", "main_scene_light"],
  "primNamePattern": "video_360_*",
  "trigger": { "type": "proximity", "radiusMeters": 3, "activation": "always" },
  "position": { "type": "xform", "positionOffset": [0, 50, 0] },
  "iconConfig": {
    "iconId": "vr",
    "iconName": "VR",
    "iconImage": "vr_avatar.svg",
    "mediaType": "video360",
    "iconAsset": "interaction_icons/vr.usd",
    "videosDir": "nucleus/videos/",
    "i18nKeyPattern": "interactions.{id}"
  }
}
```

Expansion: `ConfigLoader._expand_icon_group_entry` in `younite.interactions_extension/services/kit_services/config_loader/loader.py`. `mediaType: "video360"` maps to action `video360.open`. Shares the `_index_files_by_prefix` indexer with spatial sound, so the `NN_<name>.<ext>` file-naming convention and optional sidecar VTT support are identical.

Per-Xform fan-out:

- `primNamePattern: "video_360_*"` — fnmatch glob over leaf prim names under `/World`. Each match becomes one synthesised entry (`icon_video_360_1`, `icon_video_360_2`, …).
- `iconAsset` — VR headset model attached to each match via session-layer override (idempotent on hot-reload). Bare Xforms in the sublayer stay free of payload boilerplate.
- `videosDir` — directory (relative to `source/data/`) scanned for `NN_*` video files. The file whose `NN` matches the trailing digits of the prim name is bound to that spot.
- `captionsDir` — optional; defaults to `videosDir`. Sidecar `.vtt` with the same `NN_` prefix → `captionsUrl` on the synthesised iconConfig.
- `i18nKeyPattern` — `{id}` is replaced with `icon_<primName>`, so `video_360_1` → `interactions.icon_video_360_1.{greeting,title,subtitle,videoTitle}`.

